{"description":"Published, immutable rules under which evidence on a Timeline Channel with Evidence is checked. A profile is an object with content, never a bare name, and is used only through a specialisation, whose exact type selects the native support a host must implement and whose content carries the profile data.","name":"Evidence Profile","schema":{"minFields":1},"specification":{"blueId":"9MdKsAApwjLjFXTw75necZ5XPuY4o5M7SX2bF5zNrwij"}}
